{"slug": "warp", "name": "Warp", "category": "Developer Tools & IDEs", "summary": "Modern terminal. Dark IDE-like interface, block-based command UI", "description": "An inspired interpretation of Warp's design language — an agentic terminal-and-development-environment brand whose surface is a warm near-charcoal canvas (a tint warmer than pure black), broken only by clean Inter typography, the occasional Instrument Serif italic moment, and dense terminal-mockup imagery; CTAs are unusually understated, with shape geometry running tighter than most marketing sites.", "colors": [{"name": "Off White Primary", "hex": "#f7f5f0", "group": "Brand & Accent", "token": "primary", "role": "The brand's \"primary\" is a warm off-white. Used as button-primary fill, as default text on canvas, as the wordmark color. There is no chromatic brand accent — the off-white IS the brand's distinguishing tone."}, {"name": "Canvas", "hex": "#2b2622", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas", "role": "The warm dark page background. Resolved from `oklch(22.0% 0.004 84.6)`. Slightly browner than pure black, slightly warmer than a neutral gray — the warmth IS the brand's identity."}, {"name": "Canvas Soft", "hex": "#383330", "group": "Surface", "token": "canvas-soft", "role": "A lighter warm-dark fill used for cards, mockup chrome, and partner-logo tiles."}, {"name": "Hairline", "hex": "#3f3a36", "group": "Surface", "token": "hairline", "role": "1 px solid divider on dark surfaces."}, {"name": "Ink", "hex": "#f7f5f0", "group": "Text", "token": "ink", "role": "Default text on canvas — same off-white as the primary, intentionally unified."}, {"name": "Body Strong", "hex": "#dad2c1", "group": "Text", "token": "body-strong", "role": "Mid-emphasis body text."}, {"name": "Body", "hex": "#c9c0ad", "group": "Text", "token": "body", "role": "Secondary body text — captions, supporting copy, press-coverage rows."}, {"name": "Mute", "hex": "#aea69c", "group": "Text", "token": "mute", "role": "Lowest-priority tex